[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4701437033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120261#issuecomment-4701437033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120261","id":4701437033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGDo8aQ","user":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T10:15:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T10:15:45Z","body":"> The fix seems to work correctly, although not sure why originally the size was correct without this.\r\n\r\nThis was apparently introduced by 582a8ef44af9087192122ec0d4952680e4b80454.\r\nThat commit made unconditional width reservations for the revert/pin buttons in EditorProperty::get_minimum_size() (in editor_inspector.cpp) to prevent layout shifts when buttons were hidden. The goal was correct, but the consequence was that all EditorProperty rows including array element rows lose pixels to that button reservation even when they shouldn't. For array properties this means there's less room for the label column. Single digit array indices fit, but two digit indices get chopped off as there isn't enough horizontal room after that reservation is made. It also added width pressure on those rows by making the updown icon's width part of EditorSpinSlider::get_minimum_size() (in editor_spin_slider.cpp).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4701437033/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4702050078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120261#issuecomment-4702050078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120261","id":4702050078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGEOXHg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T14:32:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T14:32:33Z","body":"In that case, I would argue that this should be merged for the 4.7 release, since the regression was introduced in